title: Day3_Scarlett
---

//Setting up the scene
//<<SetCharacterLocation DialogueSignals "Scarlet" "Hallway">> --> moved this to the end of the previous conversation, since the character needs to be in place before the player gets there

Scarlet: {$name}! {$name}! #expression:sus_talking
{$name}: Scarlet? 
Scarlet: {$name}!!!!!
{$name}: Chill! I heard you the first time! What's going on, why are you freaking out?!
Scarlet: It's {$Boss}! She wants to see you!
{$name}: WHAT?! Like the boss? The big boss?
Scarlet: Like the big boss, queen of the company, she who sees all. Her
{$name}: What for? What did I do? Am in trouble?
Scarlet: Hey I'm just the messenger, I got no clue. But she doesn't request meetings for just anything.
{$name}: Oh no. Am I getting fired?
Scarlet: ...maybe a promotion?
{$name}: ...be for real. No way I've got an impromptu meeting with {$Boss} for a measly security promotion.
{$name}: I'm so dead. So so dead. 
Scarlet: Maybe... maybe it's about Cherry?#experssion:neutral_talking
{$name}: What? What do you mean?
Scarlet: Well, you're the only one she's really spoken to. Maybe she wants to know what she said?
{$name}: Or maybe she wants to crucify me for talking to her.
Scarlet: Well, she's on her way here now. Uh, try not to freak out too much?
{$name}: Glowing advice, thanks. I'll see you at lunch?
Scarlet: If you live that long... 
Scarlet: Kidding!#expression:happy
Scarlet: Mostly.

<<RemoveCharacter DialogueSignals "Scarlet">>
<<SetCharacterLocation DialogueSignals "Boss" "Hallway">>
<<jump BBEG>>

===